Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.04,0:05:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白雪公主
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.32,0:05:27.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 白雪公主她...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.70,0:05:30.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:33.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我心爱的白雪公主啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.86,0:05:37.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有点太过头了...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.60,0:05:40.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多么美丽的容颜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:42.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多么白皙的玉手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.80,0:05:46.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你演树的话为什么来阻碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.98,0:05:50.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为剧本里根本就没有握手的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.95,0:05:52.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是王子就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.98,0:05:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且 胖虎演王子就...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.06,0:05:58.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜拳决定的 你有意见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.80,0:06:01.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过王子应该像我这样有风度的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.81,0:06:04.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说我没风度吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.25,0:06:06.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够了 你们住手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:08.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子根本无法练习了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.52,0:06:09.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.31,0:06:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得我拿『万能舞台装置』给你们制造气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.67,0:06:15.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,练习中止
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.32,0:06:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们总是这么快就出问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦你们了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.93,0:06:26.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样会赶不上学艺会的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来我就对演《白雪公主》没什么兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 我觉得是很感人的故事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:38.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 公主 巫婆 真的存在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.45,0:06:41.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道 毕竟《白雪公主》只是个童话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 我是时候去补习了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.33,0:06:46.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉我先回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.07,0:06:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.42,0:06:49.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 我也要回去店里帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.69,0:06:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎也要吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.32,0:06:53.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 这个借我用一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.22,0:06:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:56.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么关系嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.01,0:07:04.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 一时手滑按了老鼠军团的按键
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:07.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.27,0:07:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.51,0:07:09.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 振作点
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.92,0:07:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老鼠 老 鼠...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.86,0:07:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他到底想用来做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿它用来做演唱会的练习是最好不过的道具了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:26.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级巨星的舞台是... 这个 这个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.71,0:07:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,观众有... 十万人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:31.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:56.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开唱了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.30,0:08:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 今天的服装可是新的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.10,0:08:11.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我要尽情唱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.89,0:08:21.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 被拿走了？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:23.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 去要回来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.18,0:08:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『物件交换布』
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.02,0:08:28.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是可以将东西跟东西交换的布
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你有什么不要的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.03,0:08:33.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要的东西... 有一袋垃圾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.88,0:08:40.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用『交换布』包住 然后大喊要交换的东西就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.48,0:08:41.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.37,0:08:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.21,0:08:43.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.41,0:08:44.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交换
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.30,0:08:46.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你喊太快了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是胖虎 是孩子王
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.21,0:08:55.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快想办法啊 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:09:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,300)}哆啦A梦～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:21.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 我正沉浸在演唱会欢乐着的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.82,0:10:24.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么想听的话 来我家就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:27.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是有十万人观众的演唱会啊 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.90,0:10:32.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是用『万能舞台装置』开演唱会啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.45,0:10:34.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是绝对不会还回来的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.47,0:10:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用其他的方法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『时空洞』 跟 『时空取物器』
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:42.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选好时间地点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.56,0:10:45.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后用『时空取物器』取回来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:47.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就选今晚的胖虎家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.26,0:10:56.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.17,0:10:59.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,睡得很熟呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.78,0:11:01.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在枕头旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.94,0:11:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再靠近一点吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.11,0:11:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试试
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.06,0:11:10.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 让我来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:11.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.42,0:11:12.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.11,0:11:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.18,0:11:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.62,0:11:24.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松不开啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.49,0:11:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.97,0:11:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.21,0:11:32.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这是你搞的鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.00,0:11:32.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆 哆啦A...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.43,0:11:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住 我不会放过你的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.86,0:11:39.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 大雄 『时空洞』...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.28,0:11:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.64,0:11:51.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.76,0:11:56.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太胡闹了 所以『时空洞』的时空混乱了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.58,0:12:00.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么一回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:02.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发生什么事了 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.79,0:12:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么 不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.73,0:12:06.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.02,0:12:07.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么再联络吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.80,0:12:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.71,0:12:09.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.86,0:12:10.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.32,0:12:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.22,0:12:22.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脏兮兮的 什么没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.17,0:12:24.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去给我洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:12.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗完舒服多了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.68,0:13:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.23,0:13:15.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得快点...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.15,0:13:19.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:20.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有小偷进来了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.34,0:13:28.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.15,0:13:32.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看那里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.82,0:13:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么 猫吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.07,0:13:39.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.03,0:13:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.38,0:13:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我的测验卷 还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.22,0:13:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.28,0:13:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 好像连接到什么地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.83,0:13:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 来一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.96,0:13:58.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.55,0:14:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.55,0:14:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 这是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.60,0:14:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.25,0:14:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好茂密的丛林
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.68,0:14:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点回去比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.05,0:14:28.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我要拿回零分测验卷
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.47,0:14:31.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.67,0:14:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们不要走太远比较好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.52,0:14:36.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你逃不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.30,0:14:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.93,0:14:48.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.39,0:14:50.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还差一点就能拿回来的说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.43,0:14:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.12,0:14:54.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.37,0:15:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:07.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.22,0:15:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.54,0:15:18.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.61,0:15:20.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.24,0:15:23.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了等等嘛...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.09,0:15:28.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点过来这边
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.24,0:15:30.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像跟我们言语不通
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.77,0:15:33.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『翻译蒟蒻』
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.55,0:15:37.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:45.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请等等 我们并不是什么可疑人物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.98,0:15:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.91,0:15:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来无法沟通了 快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.57,0:15:53.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.85,0:15:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然有这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.55,0:16:05.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.60,0:16:10.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟大雄好像
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:12.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,究竟 你是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定是尼迪娜用妖术变出来的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.16,0:16:18.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认识什么尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:20.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现出你的真面目吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.74,0:16:21.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.64,0:16:23.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『魔术棒』
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.26,0:16:28.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:31.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又用什么妖术了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.11,0:16:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.59,0:16:34.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.77,0:16:35.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.40,0:16:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 事情越来越复杂了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 掉到沼泽去了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.43,0:17:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.40,0:17:14.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.77,0:17:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.07,0:17:23.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:27.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤脑筋 这样更分不出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.01,0:17:42.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.19,0:17:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这样子 快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.67,0:17:48.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说住手
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.15,0:17:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.67,0:17:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 帮帮我 帮帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.62,0:18:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那是什么样子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.98,0:18:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要笑 快帮忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.55,0:18:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.04,0:18:09.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.23,0:18:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不到我们像得 连波波露都弄错
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:22.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我也给弄糊涂了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.54,0:18:26.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来你们跟尼迪娜没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.21,0:18:28.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你终于明白了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.58,0:18:32.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不重要  这里到底是哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.28,0:18:35.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是太阳王国 玛雅娜国
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.13,0:18:48.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是这个国家的王子 迪奥
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.59,0:18:50.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:54.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 玛雅娜国是在哪儿的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.32,0:18:59.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来是『时空洞』超越了时代 跟某个地方连接了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.46,0:19:02.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是我的宠物 波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏习惯是喜欢乱收集东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.72,0:19:09.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的测验卷在哪儿 还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.51,0:19:11.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们才是 从哪儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.25,0:19:14.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,报上名来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.40,0:19:16.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.82,0:19:19.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比大雄 来自日本
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.76,0:19:22.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本？  从没听过
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.23,0:19:23.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在北方还是南方的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.51,0:19:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个...怎么说明才好呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.02,0:19:29.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 从这个洞穴来的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.69,0:19:32.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么说 日本就在这个洞咯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.70,0:19:35.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以说了 怎么说明才好呢...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.40,0:19:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与其说明 让他看更好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:39.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.50,0:19:46.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这究竟是...难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.23,0:19:48.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们快回去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.87,0:19:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等一下去 落了东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.28,0:19:55.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 你放在去哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.27,0:20:03.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 总是「波波」叫的让人头痛的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.51,0:20:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是王子殿下哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.30,0:20:09.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:19.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 还真收集了不少破烂
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.66,0:20:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的零分试卷 还有漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:28.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我重要的东西 要还给我哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.39,0:20:32.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 不可以再做这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.26,0:20:33.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是王子殿下的命令
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.84,0:20:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.99,0:20:37.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.06,0:20:39.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实是在这边的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:42.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都已经再三嘱咐要你们好好看护王子的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实在很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 先在这附近找找
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.34,0:20:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果王子有什么意外就不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.86,0:20:55.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然在这种地方
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.23,0:21:03.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 是时候回王宫了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.73,0:21:07.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是王子 我是野比大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.33,0:21:09.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:12.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 请戴上玛雅娜的面具
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.38,0:21:14.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们将我跟迪奥弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.55,0:21:16.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥就是王子殿下您的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.10,0:21:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:25.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.48,0:21:28.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『哆啦梦』是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.20,0:21:36.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:48.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树里面居然有这样的房间
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.72,0:21:50.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是用什么魔法变出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.84,0:21:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了这不是魔法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.28,0:21:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.77,0:21:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这叫做漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:21:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本的文字吗 写着些什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.17,0:22:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.02,0:22:05.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡萩 叭叭叭叭叭 糟糕 哇 多多多多
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.22,0:22:06.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.77,0:22:10.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 不过大雄可真慢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.72,0:22:14.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.67,0:22:19.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 弄的满地泥沙 被妈妈看到的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.05,0:22:21.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要擅自走动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.72,0:22:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啰嗦 不准对王子下命令
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.96,0:22:32.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,墙壁吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.27,0:22:45.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎光临魔术世界
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.00,0:22:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 你一定是魔法师尼迪娜的手下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.28,0:22:50.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先小试牛刀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.20,0:22:51.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放马过来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.60,0:22:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快从箱子里面出来跟我一决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.05,0:23:03.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就吓到的话还早着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.24,0:23:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶的妖术师
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.47,0:23:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 给我出来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.86,0:23:14.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃得真快
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.47,0:23:18.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好妈妈不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.30,0:23:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.49,0:23:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的妈妈 这个家里最可怕的人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.53,0:23:27.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是谁 得罪王子的人都不可饶恕
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.78,0:23:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 先洗干净身上的泥沙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.37,0:23:34.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通的淋浴
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.20,0:23:36.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之先洗干净
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.82,0:23:39.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瀑 瀑布...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.96,0:23:44.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『衣物瞬间干燥机』
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.03,0:23:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起风了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.81,0:23:47.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就会干的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.09,0:23:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 这个国家全是魔法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.74,0:23:54.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 我饿了 拿点食物给我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.99,0:23:58.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是任性
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:23:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.74,0:24:00.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想吃什么
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.47,0:24:08.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好冷 这股寒气是什么 快关上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.97,0:24:13.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么吃杯面好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.28,0:24:15.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等我烧开水
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.55,0:24:19.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喷火了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这 这是什么 居然在森林的里面
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.82,0:24:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 迪奥大人 回朝
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.55,0:24:58.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当王子真威风啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.01,0:25:06.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 已经回到王宫了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.45,0:25:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是迪奥家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.58,0:25:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我家根本没法比
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.50,0:25:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么 辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.67,0:25:18.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我走了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.96,0:25:21.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 替您更衣吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.29,0:25:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下怎么弄得这么脏
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.39,0:25:28.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 我自己洗就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.05,0:25:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您说什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.49,0:25:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,饶了我吧...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.94,0:25:37.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当王子原来有这么多人伺候 真有点过意不去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.76,0:25:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是威风凛凛
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.31,0:25:52.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多好吃的 真的可以吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.06,0:25:53.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不客气了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.04,0:26:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃 当王子的生活太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.88,0:26:02.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么好吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.74,0:26:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是第一次吃到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.56,0:26:07.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真会做菜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.55,0:26:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好妈妈不在家...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.19,0:26:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.68,0:26:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈回来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.38,0:26:15.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 哆啦A梦 你们在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.96,0:26:17.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.52,0:26:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 妈妈 我要跟她决斗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.31,0:26:23.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 还是暂时先回到丛林里去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.53,0:26:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃得好饱 王子的生活很适合我
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.04,0:26:35.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.13,0:26:38.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 你居然知道我在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.37,0:26:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露告诉我们的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.18,0:26:43.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.27,0:26:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被看到有两个王子就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.22,0:26:49.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.10,0:26:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我要藏起来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.18,0:26:55.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么事要差遣吗
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.90,0:26:58.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事 退下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.33,0:27:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害 大雄还真有王子的模样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.66,0:27:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我请安
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.95,0:27:08.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你又这么得意忘形...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.93,0:27:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有事拜托你们 跟我交换身份
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.99,0:27:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我当王子？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.16,0:27:21.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 我当你 想去了解一下日本
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.47,0:27:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且要找寻打倒尼迪娜的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.52,0:27:26.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒尼迪娜？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.15,0:27:42.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜曾经是玛雅娜国的神官长
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.04,0:27:47.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是后来开始使用旁门左道的妖术 迷惑民心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.32,0:27:49.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后将她驱逐了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.15,0:27:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以尼迪娜将迪奥的妈妈诅咒以至长眠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.49,0:27:57.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注意言词 你们不可直呼我名字  要叫王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.11,0:27:59.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.83,0:28:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被驱逐出国家的尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.77,0:28:08.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在在没人敢接近的白骨森林深处的黑暗神殿里
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在身体日渐衰弱的母后身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.15,0:28:23.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾向太阳之神起过誓
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.20,0:28:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定要打倒尼迪娜 帮母后解除诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.15,0:28:31.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了这个 我要变得更强
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.17,0:28:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 只是短时间内交换应该没关系吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.42,0:28:37.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行 我已经觉得够烦了...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.94,0:28:39.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是为了帮助人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.38,0:28:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.18,0:28:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 就这么决定
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.19,0:28:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天开始交换 行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.16,0:28:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.85,0:28:59.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说什么帮助人 其实是你自己想换而已吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.88,0:29:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被妈妈发现的话该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.60,0:29:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经发现了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.45,0:29:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.85,0:29:09.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄得这么乱 快给我收拾干净
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.38,0:29:19.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你们交换衣服吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.68,0:29:22.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄戴上假发
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.28,0:29:25.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子戴上帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.44,0:29:29.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要戴上没有度数的眼镜
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.05,0:29:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 这样就没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.08,0:29:34.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都不会发现
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.58,0:29:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很像我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.24,0:29:38.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不好看 不过没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.18,0:29:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安全起见 给你『备用百宝袋』带在身旁
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.22,0:29:44.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别太勉强
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.33,0:29:45.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.38,0:29:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里真大啊 很容易迷路的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.87,0:30:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.21,0:30:07.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免礼 免礼 大家辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.13,0:30:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心情真舒畅
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.99,0:30:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里在做什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.69,0:30:26.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.21,0:30:35.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 要更加积极地接近对手
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.34,0:30:38.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.28,0:30:41.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是叫我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.57,0:30:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正好想去接你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.26,0:30:47.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧 开始练习
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.78,0:30:53.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 来吧 哪个方向过来都行
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.99,0:30:55.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选你擅长的的攻击方式吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.81,0:30:58.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.06,0:30:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.93,0:31:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 加油
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.33,0:31:06.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.89,0:31:07.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有破绽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.45,0:31:12.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.97,0:31:15.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子一定是训练不足
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.69,0:31:18.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 麻烦你照顾王子
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.46,0:31:19.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.99,0:31:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 继续练习
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.25,0:31:27.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你不要太擅自乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.44,0:31:29.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难得我们收拾干净的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.78,0:31:31.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.69,0:31:34.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.41,0:31:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香你好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.18,0:31:37.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午安
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.51,0:31:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 这本书从图书馆借来的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.86,0:31:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以用来做戏剧的参考
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.62,0:31:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么书 给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.61,0:31:48.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点用处也没有
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.77,0:31:51.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人太碍事了 回去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.74,0:31:57.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.29,0:31:59.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香 其实他是...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.00,0:31:59.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.97,0:32:01.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.40,0:32:05.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么做 别人当然会气跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.63,0:32:07.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟我无关
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.33,0:32:09.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在要出去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.06,0:32:10.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你的便
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.98,0:32:21.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么接近了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.94,0:32:28.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是可怕的怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.98,0:32:31.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能大意
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.97,0:32:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.39,0:32:42.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真危险
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.99,0:32:45.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 飞上天了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.47,0:32:47.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要乱动
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.31,0:32:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,野比 你...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.35,0:32:58.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老师 很抱歉 这是有很复杂的原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.13,0:32:59.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上帮你收拾好
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.34,0:33:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您醒过来了啊 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.88,0:33:10.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.14,0:33:14.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下不要开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.06,0:33:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.79,0:33:17.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.48,0:33:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 难道是被爸爸打到的关系...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.77,0:33:24.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 没事 我很精神
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.74,0:33:29.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.06,0:33:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.83,0:33:33.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经打磨好了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.93,0:33:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.82,0:33:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望王子殿下能戴上它
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.06,0:33:39.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.82,0:33:41.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.00,0:33:45.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 合适吗 我会好好珍惜的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.55,0:33:49.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.83,0:33:53.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没 只是觉得王子殿下跟平时不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.87,0:33:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下这么高兴 还是第一次见到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.73,0:34:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得很幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.44,0:34:04.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这个收到这条项链 所以特别高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.82,0:34:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 我想出去散步 帮我带路吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.16,0:34:15.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下说要自己一个人出去真少有
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.51,0:34:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.50,0:34:20.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过《白雪公主》里面的王子就是一个人出去的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.00,0:34:22.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得那是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.05,0:34:30.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轮到我了 去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.65,0:34:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些小孩子在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.99,0:34:39.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用绳子玩占卜 王子不是也玩过的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.60,0:34:42.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 真不走运
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.18,0:34:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.70,0:34:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有趣的样子 让我也加入吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.03,0:34:53.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 怎么了 为什么要逃啊 回来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.61,0:35:00.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家为什么要逃走呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.15,0:35:02.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为突然见到王子的关系
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.46,0:35:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知不觉地玩起翻花绳了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.53,0:35:09.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮 形状好像蝴蝶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.78,0:35:11.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 那么...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.73,0:35:15.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是鱼对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.76,0:35:17.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,扫帚
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.04,0:35:18.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 这次是...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.76,0:35:21.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桥
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.22,0:35:23.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 这是什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.71,0:35:25.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.19,0:35:27.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是花 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.64,0:35:30.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.13,0:35:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 这个什.......么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.39,0:35:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,树
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.21,0:35:38.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对 是枪
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.08,0:35:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜  是东京铁塔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.79,0:35:42.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东京铁塔？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.39,0:35:44.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东京铁塔是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.83,0:35:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 对啊 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.55,0:35:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 是怎么做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.80,0:35:51.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想学 可以教我吗
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.66,0:35:53.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.16,0:35:55.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊 那就教你们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.39,0:35:59.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个怪物的真面目是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.74,0:36:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是怪物 是叫车的交通工具
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.81,0:36:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你不要一个人出去好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.74,0:36:08.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要对我下命令
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.49,0:36:09.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.73,0:36:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.54,0:36:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.08,0:36:16.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.33,0:36:19.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然叫我「这家伙」
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.17,0:36:23.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 说去什么学艺会练习
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.27,0:36:24.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实是跑去玩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.50,0:36:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 无礼的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.31,0:36:34.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是在玩 我可是肩负重大的使命
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.05,0:36:35.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要说梦话
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.87,0:36:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去给我除草
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.96,0:36:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是王子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.23,0:36:43.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是王子的话 妈妈就是女王
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.66,0:36:46.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去除草
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.54,0:36:47.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.59,0:36:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就说过了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.63,0:36:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 玉米
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.74,0:36:59.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有点像了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.24,0:37:02.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天再不下雨的话就惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.70,0:37:05.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是尼迪娜的诅咒吗
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.10,0:37:08.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女王陛下也是因为她 直到现在还长眠着
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.60,0:37:10.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天知道会怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.34,0:37:13.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜是 那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.76,0:37:17.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都怕她 一切都是因为她的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.72,0:37:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不下雨 并不是因为什么诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.83,0:37:24.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那为什么还要举行活祭品仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.48,0:37:26.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,活祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.13,0:37:54.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神圣之泉塞纳迪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.74,0:37:57.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在献上我们的活祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.90,0:38:00.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请解除尼迪娜的诅咒
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.30,0:38:02.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让上天赐予我们雨水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.16,0:38:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你去吧 永远伺候在神的旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.74,0:38:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.28,0:38:12.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.27,0:38:14.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 住手
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.28,0:38:17.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 您这是怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.27,0:38:20.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对不允许进行活祭品仪式
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.57,0:38:24.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您说什么 王子殿下不是也已经同意了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.93,0:38:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说不行就是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.97,0:38:30.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能不理会等待雨水的民众
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.82,0:38:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快点去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.68,0:38:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 只要下雨就行了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.80,0:38:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『气象盒』
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.07,0:38:43.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好带着『备用百宝袋』来
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.91,0:38:46.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放入『雨云卡』
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.50,0:38:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.91,0:38:57.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇迹 不用献上活祭品也能下雨了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.49,0:39:00.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.11,0:39:03.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 到底是怎样做到的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.26,0:39:06.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之 这样仪式可以终止了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.21,0:39:27.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子什么时候拥有如此的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.03,0:39:32.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时日临近 我们报仇的日子快到了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.01,0:39:35.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们也差不多该出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.45,0:39:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了 你很少这么勤奋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.72,0:39:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有生以来 还是第一次除草
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.27,0:39:49.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喝点东西吧 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.71,0:39:54.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个真可口
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.66,0:39:57.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮助人后喝的东西是不是特别清爽可口
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.65,0:40:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.09,0:40:03.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 大雄 说我是母后...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.65,0:40:15.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么王子殿下 明天也交换吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.98,0:40:19.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我学到不少了 哆啦梦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.52,0:40:23.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A梦 给我记好名字
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.59,0:40:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 还那么任性
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.67,0:40:28.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一辈子做王子也无所谓哦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.08,0:40:30.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.21,0:40:34.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里有个叫谷谷 像静香般温柔的女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.49,0:40:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.46,0:40:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.07,0:40:40.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 没什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.23,0:40:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真期待明天
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.55,0:40:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.58,0:40:56.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.98,0:40:58.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我 谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.73,0:40:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.79,0:41:02.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的王子殿下真威风啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.33,0:41:04.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我也不同意活祭品仪式的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.86,0:41:07.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来就是想说这个的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.69,0:41:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没其他事了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.40,0:41:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.67,0:41:14.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很忙 退下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.86,0:41:16.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.62,0:41:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认输了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.63,0:41:40.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莫加 太没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.49,0:41:41.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奥 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.37,0:41:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认输了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.00,0:41:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没用 算了 回家睡觉去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.23,0:41:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢殿下指导
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.79,0:42:00.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 去看看母后吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.54,0:42:04.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么晚突然被叫出来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.35,0:42:06.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子也太任性了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.22,0:42:10.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是也不能违抗他啊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.59,0:42:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶尔输给他 让他高兴是最好的做法
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.74,0:42:17.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子保护得了这个国家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.40,0:42:25.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 请告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.85,0:42:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样才能变强
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.09,0:42:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样才能做个像父王那样称职的玛雅娜国国王—『太阳王』
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.17,0:42:38.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 我还不够成熟
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.50,0:42:54.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.22,0:42:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着 今天做什么好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.93,0:43:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.45,0:43:01.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.23,0:43:03.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我伊沙姆
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.91,0:43:06.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来接您去接受棒术练习的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.09,0:43:16.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在这种地方很危险的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.89,0:43:18.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.55,0:43:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 太胡闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.10,0:43:25.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了吧 哆啦梦 是我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.29,0:43:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.83,0:43:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哟 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.07,0:43:30.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最坏的事情发生了...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.15,0:43:34.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前的晚上你那强力胶可把我给害惨了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.07,0:43:36.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天我是来还给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.84,0:43:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 其实...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.25,0:43:39.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无礼的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.29,0:43:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这下子...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.00,0:43:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有种就跟我去空地
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.82,0:43:46.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求之不得
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.16,0:43:51.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在才开始决胜负
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.69,0:43:52.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.61,0:43:53.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.29,0:43:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办 怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.99,0:44:01.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.98,0:44:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.99,0:44:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认输了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.50,0:44:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎么了 昨天也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.11,0:44:16.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一点也不像平时的王子
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.78,0:44:20.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请站起来 直到你恢复平时的身手
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.37,0:44:22.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要好好练习
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.34,0:44:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.12,0:44:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的大雄太过棘手了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.43,0:44:36.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不赖嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.46,0:44:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 胜负...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.68,0:44:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到此为止吧\N胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.28,0:44:42.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.31,0:44:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到谁先死为止
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.99,0:44:47.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.39,0:44:48.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.25,0:44:52.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.90,0:44:57.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最讨厌这样的大雄了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.93,0:45:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.62,0:45:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实这个大雄 并不是真正的大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.08,0:45:14.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.77,0:45:16.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.12,0:45:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.67,0:45:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我受不了棒术练习
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.80,0:45:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然不是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.52,0:45:27.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的分不出来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.88,0:45:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说 这家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.53,0:45:33.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 这位是王子殿下咯
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.47,0:45:35.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.77,0:45:36.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.57,0:45:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.30,0:45:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.11,0:45:40.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.91,0:45:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪这么强\N{\pos(432,438)\fs25}(遇到了各种各样的事)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.18,0:45:38.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不赖\N{\pos(432,438)\fs25}(有些什么 嗯 然后呢)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.35,0:45:40.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,够资格做玛雅娜国的战士\N{\pos(432,438)\fs25}(嗯 果然...)
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.55,0:45:41.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.81,0:45:44.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有座很宏伟的金字塔
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.19,0:45:47.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有很多珍贵的动物 就好像...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.53,0:45:48.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,童话世界
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.95,0:45:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.93,0:45:52.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 也带我们去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.92,0:45:54.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.13,0:45:57.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 拜托了 带我们去玛雅娜国吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.64,0:46:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我招待大家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.18,0:46:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 决定好了 出发去玛雅娜国
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.71,0:46:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 这样子不行 要换好玛雅娜国的服装
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.26,0:46:12.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『换衣服照相机』
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.03,0:46:26.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是玛雅娜国吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.17,0:46:28.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是丛林而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.03,0:46:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王宫在这前面
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.49,0:46:32.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美丽的绿色
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.08,0:46:34.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不好呢 居然要这样子...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.91,0:46:37.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为被看到有两位王子就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.91,0:46:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.61,0:46:40.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很适合你啊 雄子
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.96,0:46:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 不要这样子啦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.87,0:46:44.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.60,0:46:57.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 这里就是王子的寝室吗
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.76,0:46:59.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.21,0:47:01.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部是用石头做的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.26,0:47:03.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外面更宏伟哦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.67,0:47:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 是我谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.14,0:47:11.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用怕 他们是日本国来的我的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.21,0:47:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个 我爸爸在找您
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.52,0:47:16.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.53,0:47:19.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你带大家去参观玛雅娜国吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.85,0:47:22.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 我叫谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.99,0:47:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫静香
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.47,0:47:26.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.20,0:47:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶叫 不 我叫雄子
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.76,0:47:30.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.11,0:47:31.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.60,0:47:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 谷谷 拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.00,0:47:34.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.86,0:47:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犀利
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.30,0:47:39.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然看过遗迹的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.55,0:47:42.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,实物原来是这么漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.11,0:47:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能来太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.64,0:47:45.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.26,0:47:51.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是市集
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.81,0:47:53.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真热闹呢
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.02,0:48:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.83,0:48:04.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真少有啊 居然跟王子殿下以外的人亲近
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.52,0:48:07.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我是容易跟动物友好的类型...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.34,0:48:17.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是斗技场
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.80,0:48:21.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛雅娜国的男性 从小就要接受棒术练习
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.93,0:48:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讨厌\N我也想试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.19,0:48:29.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 找到王子殿下了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.68,0:48:30.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.98,0:48:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下跟这些客人在房里
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.98,0:48:34.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.42,0:48:38.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家好 都过了练习时间了 王子殿下却...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.51,0:48:41.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大叔 请教我棒术
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.68,0:48:43.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.43,0:48:46.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是日本国来的王子殿下的客人
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.93,0:48:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.45,0:48:51.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 好吧 我就教你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.85,0:48:54.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.41,0:48:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.45,0:48:56.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 放心
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.38,0:49:00.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸是玛雅娜国的棒术教练
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.32,0:49:01.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.83,0:49:03.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.22,0:49:11.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后 白雪公主跟王子终于能在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.48,0:49:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过着幸福快乐的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.61,0:49:16.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样 是不是很感人的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.47,0:49:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 很感人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.32,0:49:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥王子是怎样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.24,0:49:24.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然有点不容易亲近
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.24,0:49:27.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最近却变得很温柔
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.09,0:49:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了 还教会了我玩翻花绳
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.52,0:49:36.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 你不能跟谷谷说交换身份的事
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.69,0:49:44.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳄鱼 鳄鱼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.59,0:49:45.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.76,0:49:46.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.74,0:49:49.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这条河没有鳄鱼的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.80,0:49:52.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我确实看到的 很大的
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.54,0:49:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你的倒影吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.56,0:49:58.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 的确是看到了啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.46,0:50:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.18,0:50:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 表演翻花绳给我们看看好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.58,0:50:16.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你表演一下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.54,0:50:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放肆 走开
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.80,0:50:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们以为王子殿下是什么人
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.77,0:50:21.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.84,0:50:31.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 就这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.79,0:50:34.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 记住刚刚的呼吸方法
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.69,0:50:37.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 伊沙姆老师 再一次好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.72,0:50:39.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.28,0:50:41.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奥 那家伙真行呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.82,0:50:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然第一次接触 却学得很快
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.93,0:50:47.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害 说不定连任性王子都不是他的对手呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.67,0:50:51.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奥 莫加
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.79,0:50:53.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.42,0:50:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们去球技场准备沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.47,0:50:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.59,0:50:59.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.50,0:51:03.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下要进行沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.34,0:51:05.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:05.96,0:51:08.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下要进行沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.51,0:51:14.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷小姐 不好了 王子殿下要进行沙加地
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.23,0:51:16.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.03,0:51:18.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沙加地是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.49,0:51:21.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛雅娜国流传下来的球技
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.39,0:51:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,方法是使用脚控球射入对方龙门
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.86,0:51:30.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最先取得三分就算胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.97,0:51:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟足球一样嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.56,0:51:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那为什么这么紧张
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.48,0:51:56.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这场比赛 是必须以性命做赌注的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.35,0:52:02.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,败者要听凭对方的任何要求
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.22,0:52:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是被对方夺取性命
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.57,0:52:06.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然这样
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.49,0:52:08.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下只有一个人而已
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.46,0:52:09.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样怎么比
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.51,0:52:16.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好了 认真地来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.76,0:52:17.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.40,0:52:19.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认真可以吗 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.48,0:52:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.35,0:52:55.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太过分了 刚刚犯规啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.52,0:52:57.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手没碰到球就不算的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.91,0:52:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然有这种规则
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.43,0:53:01.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 这次一定要...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.17,0:53:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赢定了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.64,0:53:21.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去 王子殿下的性命...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.00,0:53:23.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个人对两个人太勉强了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.82,0:53:25.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.30,0:53:26.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.04,0:53:32.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偶 不 我来帮王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.98,0:53:35.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.80,0:53:40.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不需要你帮忙 回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.89,0:53:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 虽然我来帮忙可能帮不了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.63,0:53:50.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 我不认为一加一会小于一
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.95,0:53:54.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为 你并非孤单一人的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.88,0:53:57.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.54,0:53:59.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这边用两个人继续比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.75,0:54:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多一个人又怎样 只不过是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.93,0:54:07.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们上 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.32,0:54:08.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.63,0:54:14.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.85,0:54:25.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 放开我
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.23,0:54:26.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的好 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.03,0:54:33.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.13,0:54:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.97,0:54:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.74,0:54:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进了 太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.42,0:54:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.21,0:55:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.56,0:55:03.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同分了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.94,0:55:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 只差一分而已
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.51,0:55:08.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输了就糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.51,0:55:09.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.02,0:55:23.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.29,0:55:26.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做的好 大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.88,0:55:33.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.81,0:55:40.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.68,0:55:42.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.55,0:55:44.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.82,0:55:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 我们赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.42,0:55:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.06,0:56:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 请对他们进行处分
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.05,0:56:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 就交给你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.38,0:56:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随你怎么处置
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.29,0:56:05.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.97,0:56:07.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.06,0:56:09.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 饶了他们吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.33,0:56:11.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 饶了他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.09,0:56:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 大家都很努力 玩得很开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.94,0:56:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.11,0:56:19.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说了随我处置的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.09,0:56:21.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 饶了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.52,0:56:23.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.94,0:56:27.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡奥 莫加 这次就放过你们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.95,0:56:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感谢圣恩
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.25,0:56:34.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.83,0:56:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄那家伙真有气度啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.83,0:56:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.09,0:56:40.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.57,0:56:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 虽然那帮人有点奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.87,0:56:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他们是我的得力伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.07,0:56:57.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.93,0:56:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.93,0:57:01.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.15,0:57:04.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看 东京铁塔
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.98,0:57:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么 真无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.03,0:57:12.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最讨厌这样的大雄了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.84,0:57:15.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.04,0:57:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.66,0:58:02.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.75,0:58:11.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.97,0:58:16.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个是...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.87,0:58:18.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.47,0:58:26.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 谷谷被我带走了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.12,0:58:27.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个声音是 尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.72,0:58:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用她做食之仪式的祭品
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.81,0:58:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.54,0:58:38.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想救她的话就自己一个人来黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.95,0:58:41.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得是自己一个人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.03,0:58:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.55,0:58:52.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我卡奥
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.21,0:58:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我莫加也在
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.60,0:58:55.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚的话都听到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.55,0:58:58.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 真的太可怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.47,0:59:01.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 这事千万不能对其他人说
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.54,0:59:05.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会照尼迪娜说的自己一个人去救谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.90,0:59:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准对其他人说 这是命令
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.18,0:59:09.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.67,0:59:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 谷谷
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.95,0:59:23.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们到底去了哪儿
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.42,0:59:24.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆师傅
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.98,0:59:26.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.13,0:59:28.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.43,0:59:29.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是说了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.46,0:59:30.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:31.78,0:59:32.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.53,0:59:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 王子殿下呢 去了哪儿呢 王子殿下\N- 好 加油吧　- 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.83,0:59:36.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.21,0:59:38.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.37,0:59:39.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.54,0:59:41.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.07,0:59:42.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您平安无事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.26,0:59:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了 忘了戴假发
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.45,0:59:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经救了谷谷大人了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.58,0:59:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷她怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.12,0:59:53.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚被尼迪娜掠走了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.67,0:59:57.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底发生了什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.13,1:00:00.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实 我是...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.88,1:00:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.04,1:00:03.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是真正的王子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.63,1:00:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么说谷谷跟...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.47,1:00:06.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.69,1:00:09.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去了黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.09,1:00:10.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太鲁莽了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.64,1:00:12.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.65,1:00:14.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.81,1:00:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.75,1:00:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜说要王子一个人去...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.01,1:00:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么也没听到 再见
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.28,1:00:31.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,错不了 王子殿下去救谷谷了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.32,1:00:33.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下的枪跟头盔都不见了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.57,1:00:49.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在就去追王子
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.93,1:00:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅 我们也来帮忙
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.56,1:00:56.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽说帮忙 但尼迪娜是可怕的魔法使啊
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.39,1:00:57.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那又怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.55,1:01:02.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们这边可有22世纪科学的结晶 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.47,1:01:04.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然不太可靠
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.36,1:01:05.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真失礼
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.70,1:01:09.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆先生 黑暗神殿的方向是？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.08,1:01:11.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这边的北方
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.01,1:01:14.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 用『竹蜻蜓』去追王子殿下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.48,1:01:15.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.13,1:01:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这之前 帮忙换一下这装扮吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.78,1:01:20.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当雄子不是挺好的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.91,1:01:21.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.58,1:01:23.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 来了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.37,1:01:25.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就行了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.78,1:01:28.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么 王子殿下？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.48,1:01:29.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是看起来像而已
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.13,1:01:34.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是谷谷做的项链
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.05,1:01:38.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.54,1:01:41.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也要一起去救谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.70,1:01:43.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.98,1:01:45.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.85,1:01:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这真是粗暴的魔法
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.71,1:02:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白骨森林
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.58,1:02:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 雷电把电池打出问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.28,1:02:39.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快降落
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.99,1:02:54.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.37,1:02:57.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人吗 救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.64,1:03:00.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.56,1:03:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.65,1:03:11.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.24,1:03:12.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.60,1:03:16.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 撑着点
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.21,1:03:26.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.25,1:03:27.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要来
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.76,1:03:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 当然是为了帮王子跟谷谷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.91,1:03:33.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这跟你们没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.98,1:03:37.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会没关系 我们是朋友啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.38,1:03:40.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许我们跟王子的身份地位不同
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.33,1:03:43.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我觉得一加一肯定大于一
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.07,1:03:45.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们来帮忙不是理所当然的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.53,1:03:47.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.67,1:03:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄说的对
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.73,1:03:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了 朋友怎能见死不救呢
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.34,1:03:53.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对吧 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.35,1:03:56.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了 大雄 说的好
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.44,1:04:00.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 已经没人能帮我们了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.22,1:04:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了 大家
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.90,1:04:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 不对 王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.64,1:04:06.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫迪奥就行了 我们是朋友嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.92,1:04:07.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.74,1:04:10.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说起来你们站一起还真难区分谁是谁呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.81,1:04:11.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.22,1:04:16.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 走吧 迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.69,1:04:23.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打听过了这座山谷有个湖
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.76,1:04:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,湖的对岸就是黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.49,1:04:29.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个山谷真是幽深啊
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.48,1:04:31.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看不到谷底呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.47,1:04:34.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉下去就糟糕了 大家小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.56,1:04:40.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到尽头了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.37,1:04:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 『竹蜻蜓』
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.22,1:04:48.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 刚刚雷把电池打到出问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.71,1:04:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这悬崖
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.52,1:04:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别废话了 大家爬上去
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.58,1:05:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开 走开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.08,1:05:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.55,1:05:09.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 没完没了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.89,1:05:12.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走开 走开
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.78,1:05:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.69,1:05:20.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没办法 能飞到哪就是哪吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.26,1:05:22.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神啊 保佑我们 还差一点了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.58,1:05:24.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 不要紧吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.80,1:05:26.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.02,1:05:27.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.28,1:05:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.19,1:05:29.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.28,1:05:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶上了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.78,1:05:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是神奇的法术
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.53,1:05:37.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅 还差一点而已 一点而已
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.05,1:05:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.68,1:05:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是惊险啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.42,1:05:47.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.34,1:05:48.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 危险
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.98,1:05:50.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得去救他
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.31,1:05:51.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能的 住手
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.59,1:05:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 师傅他...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.27,1:05:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要哭哭涕涕的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.25,1:05:59.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆不是会在这种地方死掉的男人
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.05,1:06:00.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要相信他
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.70,1:06:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它们追来了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.03,1:06:06.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.74,1:06:07.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.92,1:06:09.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅 你一定...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.32,1:06:13.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定会得救的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.37,1:06:22.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我累坏了 跑不动了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.07,1:06:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该不会追到这里了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.92,1:06:26.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那里
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.16,1:06:30.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那座就是黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.39,1:06:43.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们快去救回谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.70,1:06:44.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.95,1:06:47.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就天黑了 夜里的森林是很危险的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.87,1:06:49.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 谷谷她...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.09,1:06:52.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜在明天正午之前都不会对谷谷怎么样的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.55,1:06:53.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.60,1:06:55.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为食之仪式是在明天正午
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.85,1:06:59.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么为了明天的战斗 今天就在这里扎营
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.79,1:07:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 在这之前
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.38,1:07:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要小便
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.27,1:07:05.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的 快点哦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.79,1:07:06.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真讨厌
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.36,1:07:17.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都说了要一个人来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.58,1:07:20.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却带了一堆多余的人来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.15,1:07:24.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来是打算用你做诱饵抓住王子的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.16,1:07:26.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要的只是王子而已
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.89,1:07:31.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对于胆敢阻碍明天食之仪式的家伙 一律格杀勿论
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.60,1:07:39.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥也不是任性的王子嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.31,1:07:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可是想努力成为一个仁王啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.66,1:07:45.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当真正的王子也真不简单呢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.20,1:07:49.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你不是想当王子...的吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.68,1:07:57.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正午之前要去到黑暗神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.89,1:07:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.06,1:08:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『万能溜冰鞋』
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.88,1:08:05.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滑起来感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.99,1:08:06.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.95,1:08:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.59,1:08:12.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.91,1:08:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以了 让我自己试试
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.39,1:08:17.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.75,1:08:18.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先走了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.82,1:08:20.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.43,1:08:29.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来也能在水上滑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.13,1:08:31.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊 就这样滑过湖吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.88,1:08:37.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像溜冰一样
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.66,1:08:48.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥滑得比大雄还好呢
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.78,1:08:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.58,1:08:51.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.97,1:08:55.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.16,1:09:02.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.06,1:09:04.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.33,1:09:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶可恶\N胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.84,1:09:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.83,1:09:21.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『风神扇子』
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.20,1:09:34.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.74,1:09:41.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鳄...鱼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.11,1:09:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 王子？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.32,1:09:49.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆哆哆 哆啦A梦 快拿点什么出来啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.35,1:09:52.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找我找我找我找
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.30,1:09:55.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『超级气球口香糖』
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.48,1:09:56.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.17,1:10:05.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎 怎么了 快停下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.27,1:10:08.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我下去
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.29,1:10:12.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.37,1:10:13.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是高兴的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.62,1:10:15.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去追迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.40,1:10:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.15,1:10:28.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.87,1:10:36.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没想到连瀑布也能滑
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.36,1:10:38.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这是万能型的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.58,1:10:39.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.31,1:10:55.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 动物使者雅福被打败了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.98,1:10:58.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那帮家伙到底是何方神圣
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.43,1:11:01.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食之仪式很快就要开始的说
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.33,1:11:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次由我看看情况
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.57,1:11:12.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.47,1:11:15.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕被带到黑暗神殿去了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.77,1:11:16.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 我们得赶快...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.98,1:11:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.36,1:11:21.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到迪奥了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.73,1:11:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 等等
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.54,1:11:31.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.29,1:11:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.79,1:11:43.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然你这么说 我已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.91,1:11:46.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会跟丢的 波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.50,1:11:48.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我 没力气了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.65,1:11:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.38,1:11:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.97,1:11:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.39,1:11:59.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 只是个石雕而已
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.28,1:12:02.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道哦 这在电视上看到过
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.69,1:12:03.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记得是...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.95,1:12:05.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼 眼睛动了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.20,1:12:12.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于来了啊 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.11,1:12:13.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,石像说话了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.84,1:12:15.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我不是...
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.43,1:12:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先不要说话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.21,1:12:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女孩正睡在神殿顶部的祭坛上
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.38,1:12:27.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很快就要对她实行黑暗魔术－食之仪式
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.30,1:12:30.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想救她的话就来神殿顶部吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.59,1:12:34.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个妖怪
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.68,1:12:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么嘛 不过是块岩石而已
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.98,1:12:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能再磨蹭了 快去神殿
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.51,1:12:47.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离正午已经没多少时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.11,1:12:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这儿了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.84,1:12:59.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是黑暗神殿了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.75,1:13:11.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那里的顶部
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.16,1:13:17.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.46,1:13:22.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子终于来了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.15,1:13:24.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子以外的全部抹杀
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.63,1:13:26.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 我马上来救你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.01,1:13:51.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.55,1:14:01.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事也没有
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.63,1:14:04.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.30,1:14:09.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.47,1:14:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来如此 这只是幻象而已
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.41,1:14:13.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幻象？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.16,1:14:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有控制幻象的人
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.83,1:14:30.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听好 王子 想救大家就自己一个人上来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.89,1:14:49.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.83,1:14:52.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 没事了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.10,1:15:03.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 你来救我了啊 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:04.27,1:15:05.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都平安吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.32,1:15:07.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的脚好像扭伤了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.02,1:15:10.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种程度没关系
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.65,1:15:11.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.81,1:15:21.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳升得很高了 快要正午了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.92,1:15:24.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 我现在就去救你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.24,1:15:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.36,1:15:31.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『空气炮』
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.05,1:15:32.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.70,1:15:36.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.14,1:15:43.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家 快捂住鼻子
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.54,1:15:46.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.18,1:15:48.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,犯人在那上面
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.99,1:15:51.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被识破了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.75,1:15:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是他用药迷惑我们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.76,1:15:56.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『遥控天线』 跟 『胡椒粉』
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.70,1:15:58.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次轮到我们了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.35,1:16:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小夫 麻烦你控制了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.51,1:16:01.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.74,1:16:20.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.70,1:16:27.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶 怎么这么没用
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.37,1:16:28.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.92,1:16:33.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们走 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.70,1:16:39.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.49,1:16:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于来了啊 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.72,1:16:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷就在这里 想救她的话就上来
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.48,1:16:49.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是尼迪娜吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.53,1:16:51.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蓝色狸猫 这里没你的事
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.64,1:16:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狸... 我不是什么狸猫
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.10,1:16:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.86,1:17:00.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好烫 好烫 好烫
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.42,1:17:04.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 没事吧 振作点
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.24,1:17:05.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.78,1:17:08.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 『百宝袋』烧没了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.36,1:17:13.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜 为什么要做这种事
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.38,1:17:14.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明知故问
Dialogue: 0,1:17:14.98,1:17:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要用你做食之仪式的祭品
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.99,1:17:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用我做仪式的...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.10,1:17:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当黑暗女神吞噬太阳之时
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.20,1:17:28.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗吃掉太阳的时候？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.15,1:17:29.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是指日食
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.61,1:17:34.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到时候 我就能转移到祭品的身上
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.19,1:17:37.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后 我就能得到永生
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.97,1:17:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说你要成为王子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.95,1:17:43.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后支配玛雅娜国吗
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.28,1:17:46.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是如此 真是聪明的小孩子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.21,1:17:48.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不会让你得逞
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.23,1:17:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休想妨碍我 歌德鲁 干掉他们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:04.33,1:18:05.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.64,1:18:08.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子 上来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.25,1:18:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 王子 怕了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.45,1:18:15.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他并不是...
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.48,1:18:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要说话
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.56,1:18:24.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下定决心了吗 这份勇气值得夸奖
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.99,1:18:28.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,食之仪式的时刻来临了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.01,1:18:33.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日食开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.50,1:18:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要赶上才行
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.32,1:18:45.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.55,1:18:52.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.55,1:19:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点开始交换
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.39,1:19:03.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『物件交换布』
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.35,1:19:04.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要做什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:04.57,1:19:07.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带着『备用百宝袋』啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.09,1:19:08.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟石像交换
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.89,1:19:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什 什么
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.21,1:19:15.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要做祭品
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.45,1:19:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想逃吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.29,1:19:17.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.20,1:19:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甘度
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.30,1:19:23.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我 放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.90,1:19:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.10,1:19:43.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有破绽
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.24,1:19:49.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.73,1:19:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做得好 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.11,1:19:53.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.91,1:19:56.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你平安无事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.66,1:20:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.16,1:20:15.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,厉害 不愧是我的师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.51,1:20:19.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.39,1:20:21.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我老实点
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.61,1:20:23.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死到临头还不认命啊 王子
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.25,1:20:26.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:36.77,1:20:38.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.82,1:20:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛雅娜国的人们
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.14,1:20:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许跟我作对 你们来了又能怎样
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.04,1:20:48.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让你们见识一下我尼迪娜的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.87,1:20:50.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.09,1:20:51.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.62,1:20:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.45,1:20:54.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下吗
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.27,1:20:55.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么可能
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.48,1:20:57.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.09,1:21:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.86,1:21:08.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才是王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.72,1:21:10.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.68,1:21:11.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.03,1:21:17.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然有两个王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.88,1:21:18.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.98,1:21:22.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪个 哪个才是真的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.27,1:21:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是我远方而来朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.03,1:21:27.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开你的手
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.37,1:21:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要祭品的话 就用我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.82,1:21:36.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下 请留步
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.17,1:21:39.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.20,1:21:41.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁也不要过来
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.13,1:21:44.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对朋友弃之不顾 算什么王子
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.47,1:21:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 因为你 我第一次有了真正的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.05,1:21:53.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对这些朋友 我不能见死不救
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.45,1:21:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.35,1:21:59.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好人啊 我不能坐视不管
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.56,1:22:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.01,1:22:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是王子的决定
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.60,1:22:03.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.38,1:22:10.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.76,1:22:12.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开他
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.79,1:22:17.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪个都无所谓了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.09,1:22:25.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.45,1:22:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.12,1:22:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别阻碍我
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.74,1:22:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.64,1:22:34.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认命吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.67,1:22:44.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.14,1:22:49.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这个就什么都不用怕了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.32,1:22:50.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.57,1:22:54.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住 想无论如何都违抗我吗
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.94,1:23:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.25,1:23:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.99,1:23:10.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射门
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.81,1:23:49.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是尼迪娜的本来面目
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.21,1:23:54.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜打算去哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.96,1:24:03.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.88,1:24:05.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.23,1:24:06.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼迪娜
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.84,1:24:09.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伊沙姆师傅
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.87,1:24:14.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:17.49,1:24:18.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.63,1:24:20.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.31,1:24:22.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神殿要塌了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.48,1:24:26.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.12,1:24:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.69,1:24:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.93,1:24:44.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 别管我 快走
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.97,1:24:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.02,1:24:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去我们都无法得救的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.22,1:24:49.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开手
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.30,1:24:51.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做不到
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.30,1:24:57.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么甘度会...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.31,1:24:59.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救了我们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.24,1:25:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我给它吃了『桃太郎牌驯服丸子』
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.13,1:25:04.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.94,1:25:10.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.11,1:25:11.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.29,1:25:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.29,1:25:34.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 求求你 睁开眼睛吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.00,1:25:36.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来结局不能像童话故事那样完美
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.89,1:25:38.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.72,1:25:40.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.36,1:25:48.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.69,1:25:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.63,1:25:50.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于醒来了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.89,1:25:52.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.58,1:25:53.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷 你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.10,1:25:56.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.37,1:25:58.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有两个王子...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.50,1:26:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.64,1:26:02.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快想办法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.63,1:26:05.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想她很快就会没事的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.26,1:26:07.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,起来嘛 谷谷
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.22,1:26:11.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,王子殿下
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.22,1:26:26.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后 看到您这么精神真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.67,1:26:30.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 你已经不再是王子了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.71,1:26:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要以太阳王的身份 好好统治这个王国
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.99,1:26:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,母后...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:39.63,1:26:41.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳王 万岁
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.68,1:26:52.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太阳王 万岁
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.46,1:27:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 波波露 再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.38,1:27:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.12,1:27:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.56,1:27:10.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『时空洞』的时空出问题了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:10.78,1:27:12.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不快点的话就回不去了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.74,1:27:17.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是说 已经不能再来这里吗
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.03,1:27:18.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会那样
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.36,1:27:20.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,波波露 帮我把这个还给迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.35,1:27:24.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.58,1:27:30.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迪奥 可能无法再见面了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.81,1:27:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我永远不会忘记你的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.36,1:27:34.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再见了 迪奥
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.67,1:27:36.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.66,1:27:57.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 王子殿下的角色还是由我来当最合适
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.51,1:28:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不是这样 这次由我来当
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.41,1:28:01.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也想当
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.96,1:28:02.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静香也要吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.91,1:28:04.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是这样太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.53,1:28:05.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.60,1:28:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么 猜拳决定吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.57,1:28:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 就这样就这样
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.34,1:28:11.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们真好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.27,1:28:14.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猜拳就能当王子了

